From: beau4201 <beau.ten.berge@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 13:15:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] freeholdos: stop the warm decoy at every unlock, unlock
 it before a switch

The warm decoy was stopped only after a credential unlock of the owner;
after a finger unlock it kept running with every process it started.
It is now stopped whenever the keyguard reports unlocked in the owner's
own session with no switch pending.

A switch to a decoy that is not yet unlocked resolves Settings'
FallbackHome, and the decoy then unlocks only when that placeholder goes
idle. The decoy is started in the background and awaited (bounded, 5 s)
before the switch: before OK for a typed credential, on the handler for
the finger.
